===Etymology===
From {{der|en|yi|וויגריש}}, from {{der|en|ru|вы́игрыш||winnings}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|vigorishes}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable|slang}} A [[charge]] taken on [[bet]]s, as by a [[bookie]] or gambling establishment.
# {{lb|en|uncountable|slang}} The [[interest]] on a [[loan]] of money, especially for loans made by a [[usurer]] or [[loan shark]].
# {{lb|en|countable|slang}} An amount owed on account of or payment of a bookie's charge or of interest.

